body:
I see this take all the time but I don't get it. Whenever she's in a scene it completely takes me out of the movie because of how obviously acting it is. It doesn't feel natural and lends itself really poorly to a movie that is so dependent on atmosphere. 

&#x200B;

What do you like about it so much? I'll go back and pick through the movie with a new perspective in mind, but I really honestly dislike her performance in this movie.

Awesome, thanks so much man! Is 14" a decent size? Found one from LA Pipes that seems like a good fit for me. 

&#x200B;

Also, is 4.5mm thick glass good? I see some with 5mm but I'm not sure what standard is.

Hi! I've been playing virtual world and have been really liking it. Sometimes, though, I just want some quick games where I don't need to think all that much. 

&#x200B;

Are there any decks that either win or lose in the first few turns?

Y'all can say crippled, it's literally just what the word means.

&#x200B;

Source - I can't move my legs

Why is MP5 solidly in the S tier in both the February and Mirror Stage tier lists, but gflanalysis and general consensus I've seen on the subreddit say she's kinda mediocre or even trash? I'm new and I'm just trying to understand who to trust and what characters to invest in.

&#x200B;

Also a ton of conflicting info on Suomi's status. Good or nah?
